sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Controller as ExportController
    participant Scheduler as TaskSchedulerService
    participant Pool as WorkerPool
    participant Worker as 子线程 (Worker)
    participant ExportSvc as BookExportService
    participant Gen as EpubGenerator

    Client->>+Controller: POST /export/epub
    Controller->>+Scheduler: submitExportTask(setting)
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: 创建 Task 对象 (UUID)
    Scheduler->>+Pool: addTask(task)
    Pool-->>-Scheduler: 返回 taskId
    Scheduler-->>-Controller: 返回 { taskId }
    Controller-->>-Client: 202 Accepted

    loop 线程调度
        Pool->>Pool: 获取空闲 Worker
        Pool->>+Worker: postMessage(task)
    end

    Worker->>+ExportSvc: exportBook(bookId, format, setting)
    ExportSvc->>ExportSvc: 查询书籍/章节/卷
    ExportSvc->>ExportSvc: 应用排版 (Typography)
    ExportSvc->>+Gen: generate(ebookData)
    Gen->>Gen: 生成 .epub 文件
    Gen-->>-ExportSvc: 返回 { path, filename }
    ExportSvc-->>-Worker: 返回导出结果

    Worker-->>-Pool: 任务完成消息 (TASK_COMPLETED)
    Pool->>Pool: 执行回调 (callback)